{{Quote|You're from Lothal, then?''"<br />"''Born and raised.|Zare Leonis and Jai Kell, a Lothalite|<ref name="Servants of the Empire: Rebel in the Ranks">''[[Servants of the Empire: Rebel in the Ranks]]''</ref>}}
'''Lothalites''', also called '''Lothalians''', were a cultural group of [[human]]s [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[planet]] [[Lothal]].<ref name="Databank Lothal" /> Most had a [[copper]] sheen to their skin, as exemplified by [[Ezra Bridger]],<ref name="TRB">''[[The Rebellion Begins]]''</ref> [[Ryder Azadi]],<ref name="Legacy">{{Rebels|Legacy (episode)}}</ref> and [[Morad Sumar]].<ref name="Fighter Flight">{{Rebels|Fighter Flight}}</ref>

